              to
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/epimorphisms"} epimorphisms
              (
              %a{:href => "injective+object#EquivalentCharacterizationOfInjectivesInAbelianCategories"}> prop.
              ), and that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi L
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} L
              preserves monomorphisms by assumption of exactness. With this the statement follows via adjunction isomorphism
            .maruku-equation
